willingness|ready-to-help|NOUN|readiness to do something|The state of being ready to do something without needing to be forced.|sự sẵn lòng|Her willingness to listen helped us settle the disagreement.|Sự sẵn lòng lắng nghe của cô ấy giúp chúng tôi giải quyết bất đồng.|Uncountable; willingness to is followed by an infinitive naming the action.|0
commentator|broadcast-speaker|NOUN|person describing and discussing events|A person who describes or discusses events for an audience, often during a broadcast.|bình luận viên|The commentator explained why the referee stopped the match.|Bình luận viên giải thích vì sao trọng tài dừng trận đấu.|Countable; a commentator on a subject may discuss it rather than describe a live event.|0
guest|invited-person|NOUN|person welcomed by a host|A person invited to visit someone or attend an event.|khách; người được mời|Each guest received a small card showing their seat.|Mỗi vị khách nhận một tấm thẻ nhỏ ghi chỗ ngồi của mình.|Countable; guest at an event and guest of a host describe different relationships.|0
melody|musical-line|NOUN|recognizable musical sequence|A sequence of musical notes that forms a recognizable tune.|giai điệu|The flute carries the melody while the piano provides support.|Sáo chơi giai điệu chính còn đàn piano đệm.|Countable; a melody is a musical line, while harmony concerns notes sounding together.|0
overwhelm|strong-feeling|VERB|affect with intense feeling|To affect someone with a feeling so strong that it is difficult to manage.|làm choáng ngợp về cảm xúc|Gratitude overwhelmed Mai when she read the messages of support.|Mai choáng ngợp vì lòng biết ơn khi đọc những tin nhắn động viên.|Transitive; a person may be overwhelmed by or with an emotion.|0
overwhelm|exceed-capacity|VERB|give more work than can be handled|To place so much demand on someone or something that they cannot cope adequately.|làm quá tải|A sudden flood of calls overwhelmed the small support team.|Một lượng cuộc gọi ồ ạt bất ngờ khiến nhóm hỗ trợ nhỏ bị quá tải.|Transitive; the object can be a person, team, service, or system.|1
overwhelm|defeat|VERB|defeat by greater strength|To defeat or overcome someone through much greater strength or numbers.|áp đảo; đánh bại bằng sức mạnh vượt trội|The visitors overwhelmed the home team with a series of quick attacks.|Đội khách áp đảo đội chủ nhà bằng một loạt đợt tấn công nhanh.|Transitive; this competitive sense concerns superiority rather than emotional distress.|2
